 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Bureau of Labor Statistics . Chart: Courtenay Brown/Axios 💸 Inflation stayed hot in October even as gasoline prices steadied (and are now below $4 nationally ), per new Labor Department data. More from Courtenay Brown . 💰 Anthropic is seeking to raise up to $62.5 billion in its IPO at a market cap that could top $1 trillion. That would make it one of the largest IPOs ever, but smaller than some had expected. More from Dan Primack . 🐘 Sen. Ted Cruz announced a new Austin headquarters for his group Saving Texas, which aims to win back the Lone Star State for Republicans. Cruz said in a statement first provided to Axios: "The work of rebuilding our party begins right here." More from Stef W. Kight . 
 
