A MESSAGE FROM RTX

 
 Where AI, autonomy and advanced manufacturing meet 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 RTX is driving the direction of the aerospace and defense industry, by converging:


 
 Advanced materials and manufacturing. 
 AI and autonomy. 
 Next-generation propulsion and sensing. 
 
 The integration is redefining how critical technologies are designed, built and deployed.


 Welcome to a new era. 


 
